## 4. REST API Specification

### 4.1 Group Management (`/api/collaboration/groups`)
- `POST /api/collaboration/groups`: Create study group.
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups`: List user's active groups (with filter/search).
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}`: Get detailed group information & member summary.
- `PUT /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}`: Update group details (Owner/Mod only).
- `DELETE /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}`: Delete group (Owner only).
- `POST /api/collaboration/groups/join`: Join group via `inviteCode`.
- `POST /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/leave`: Leave group.

### 4.2 Group Members (`/api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/members`)
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/members`: List members with roles and online status.
- `PUT /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/members/{userId}/role`: Update member role (Owner/Mod only).
- `DELETE /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/members/{userId}`: Remove member (Owner/Mod only).

### 4.3 Group Resources (`/api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources`)
- `POST /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources`: Upload document/image/video note + automatically trigger FastAPI AI summary.
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources`: List group resources (with filters for verified, pinned, file types).
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources/{resourceId}`: Get resource details with AI summary & key points.
- `PATCH /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources/{resourceId}/verify`: Teacher verify toggle (`isVerified`).
- `PATCH /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources/{resourceId}/pin`: Pin resource (`isPinned`).
- `DELETE /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/resources/{resourceId}`: Delete resource.

### 4.4 Resource Comments (`/api/collaboration/resources/{resourceId}/comments`)
- `GET /api/collaboration/resources/{resourceId}/comments`: Fetch threaded comments.
- `POST /api/collaboration/resources/{resourceId}/comments`: Add comment or threaded reply.
- `PUT /api/collaboration/comments/{commentId}`: Edit comment.
- `DELETE /api/collaboration/comments/{commentId}`: Delete comment.

### 4.5 Teacher Announcements (`/api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/announcements`)
- `POST /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/announcements`: Create announcement (Teacher/Owner only).
- `GET /api/collaboration/groups/{groupId}/announcements`: List announcements.

### 4.6 Notifications & Collaboration Dashboard
- `GET /api/collaboration/dashboard`: Get dashboard statistics, recent activity feed, active groups, and unread notifications.
- `GET /api/notifications`: Get user notifications.
- `PATCH /api/notifications/{id}/read`: Mark notification as read.

